						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														This will be awesome xp, but also great loot for our friendly neighborhood druids in the guild. I've also posted this in events calendar.<br />
<br />
Basically we will meet at 3PM EST at Larren by nexus.<br />
<br />
Raid Channel:<br />
/AHUmbral<br />
<br />
The mobs:<br />
These are undead. We will try and perpetually root them to keep casters from getting killed, but they will be snared and dotted while melees tank. There are other items that drop from them at times. I've seen spell drops.<br />
<br />
<br />
Method of Travel:<br />
<br />
We will group port to Dawnshroud from Nexus and hike it from there. <br />
<br />
Please Assist MT when assist is called. Healers, be sure to heal when MT is at 60 percent or below. (these guys don't hit as hard as the general in Kithicor last night)<br />
<br />
Hopefully we will have enough to handle these tough mobs.<br />
<br />
Look forward to seeing you there.<br />
<br />
Kloude						</td>
