						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Any clerics or pallys please attend: this is a great way to use your best offensive weapons: Undead DDs.  <br />
The Undead DD is the most mana-efficient spell in your arsenal: effectively you get 3points of damage per 1 point of mana. <br />
<br />
The undead dots will be great here--Sony had expanded the line of Undead spells.<br />
<br />
I'll be bringing Merilla for this.  Kloude didn't state a level limit for this, but I imagine 49+ should be the ballpark.  We shall need real tanks on this (sorry bards and rogues, but we must have taunt to soak up the aggro or the healers and casters will be chewed up in a few seconds.)<br />
<br />
Please plan to attend, this is on a SUNDAY afternoon.  <br />
<br />
The only stone I looted from there sells to the Vendors for 119plat! I want to find a few dozen more of those!<br />
<br />
Ollie						</td>
